WEBVTT

00:00:25.938 --> 00:00:31.110
(Applause)

00:00:31.694 --> 00:00:33.071
With a few exceptions,

00:00:33.071 --> 00:00:37.867
we all know that new buildings
will be dead and monotonous.

00:00:38.701 --> 00:00:40.203
Everywhere is the same.

00:00:40.661 --> 00:00:43.998
Dull, flat, straight, shiny.

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:45.208
Inhuman.

00:00:46.125 --> 00:00:49.462
They're what my daughter
calls "meh" buildings.

00:00:50.254 --> 00:00:55.009
These buildings justify themselves
as being functional.

00:00:55.551 --> 00:00:58.888
I’m a designer of buildings,
and I’ve been told so many times

00:00:58.930 --> 00:01:01.099
that form should follow function.